{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15109190","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15109190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1510919001:1":{"text":"行かせぬぞ、ペルセウス！","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，你休想离开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB5EE171475EB82A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510919002:0":{"text":"いいかげんにしろ！これ以上、お前たちに仲間を傷つけさせはしない！","source_cn":"奥法迦，够了……！雅库伯尔不会再让呼临流血！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA9A8A64544D43EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510919003:0":{"text":"なぜ分からない？\n妾は、そなたさえいてくれればいい！そばにいると、約束したではないか！","source_cn":"你为何还不懂？\\n——我只想要你留在我身边！这是你亲口...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D40D89ED239D61C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510919004:1":{"text":"先に約束を破り、妾を裏切ったのは、そなたの方じゃ！","source_cn":"是你食言在先！是你背叛了我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFACDF146E11E1EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510919005:1":{"text":"じゃが、かまわぬ……妾が代わりに約束を果たそう。どんな手を使ってでも！","source_cn":"但是没关系……我会帮你实现诺言——不管用什么办法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6194FF092F11BEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_ti